Enhancement: Show throughput (MiB/s) for `restic backup`

`restic backup` now shows a trailing 15-second throughput and an overall
throughput since the start of the operation alongside the existing
progress line. The values are reported in IEC units (KiB/s, MiB/s,
GiB/s, TiB/s) and the backup JSON status update adds `current_rate`
and `overall_rate` fields expressed in bytes per second.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/5387
